    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote2" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Current year distributions were $3,509,000, which exceeded the positive balance in unappropriated retained income by $1,166,070 as of March 31, 2026. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:p>
